<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EDS cut by Morgan Stanley.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EDS cut by Morgan Stanley.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Electronic Data Systems Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- late Thursday the information services company said it expected its 1997 earnings to fall below previous expectations.</p>
</text>
